Here’s the **SSC CGL Tier-1 English Syllabus** (latest pattern):

---

## 📘 **English Language & Comprehension (Tier-1)**

(25 Questions, 50 Marks)

### 1. **Vocabulary**

* Synonyms & Antonyms
* One Word Substitution
* Idioms & Phrases
* Spelling Test (Correct/Incorrect spelling)
* Word Substitution

### 2. **Grammar**

* Parts of Speech (Noun, Pronoun, Verb, Adjective, Adverb, Preposition, Conjunction, Interjection)
* Articles (A, An, The)
* Subject–Verb Agreement
* Tenses (All forms & correct usage)
* Voice (Active & Passive)
* Narration (Direct & Indirect Speech)
* Error Spotting (Sentence Correction / Grammar Errors)

### 3. **Reading Skills**

* Reading Comprehension (Passage based Qs)
* Cloze Test (Fill in the blanks in a passage)
* Sentence Completion & Rearrangement
* Para Jumbles

### 4. **Usage Based**

* Fill in the Blanks (Vocabulary + Grammar)
* Sentence Improvement / Correct Usage
* Commonly Confused Words & Phrasal Verbs

---

✅ **Weightage in Exam**

* Vocabulary & Idioms: \~6–8 Questions
* Grammar (Error spotting, Sentence correction, Voice, Narration): \~8–10 Questions
* Comprehension/Cloze/Para Jumbles: \~7–9 Questions

